Boomerangs are already stackable and can be wished for in packs of 20
(!), but I agree that multi throw and increased frequency are good 
ideas. Boomerang traps (with the exit point on a different square to the 
trigger(s)) sound fun, more so than (e.g.) shuriken traps. I'd like 
javelin traps too.

What I'd really like is an artifact boomerang that phases through 
anything (except sinks) until it returns to the player, attacking 
anything it hits en route with a powerful disintegration attack. 
Throwing one with dex < 20 could be hazardous to your health.

Boomerangs have at least one use currently: exercising dex with 
successful catches.


